<title>UK: European Telecom, Racal form venture.</title>
<headline>European Telecom, Racal form venture.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Telecom Plc and Racal Electronics Plc said on Thursday they were forming a joint venture to develop, market and sell vehicle tracking, navigation and information services worldwide.</p>
<p>The new company, Global Telematics Plc, will be 50 percent owned by European Telecom and 50 percent by Racal Survey Ltd, Racal's global positioning unit. Each will invest 750,000 stg of equity while a further 1.5 million stg borrowing facility is being arranged.</p>
</text>
